'''Avorius''' is an [[NPC]] that lives in {{zone|Scarleton}}.

== Quest ==
Giving {{Item|Cup of Blood|amount=1}} to '''Avorius''' while a member of the Mage [[Faction]] rewards the player with {{Reputation|mage|+5}}. This can be done once every {{Green|3}} days.

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Condition
! Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" | First Interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: Have you noticed how everyone around here kind of resembles a Vampire?
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: It would be a pretty convenient place for a Vampire to hide.
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: Not that I'm a Vampire of course - I am definitely not.
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Given a [[Cup of Blood]]
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: A Cup of Blood? What a strange present, I'm sure a Vampire would like that.
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: Thanks for the gift. I really appreciate it. Of course I won't be drinking that.
}}
|-
| class="ct" | After Given a [[Cup of Blood]]
| {{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: My thirst is quenched!
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: Err, from water and other non-Vampire liquids that is.
&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: Thank you for the gesture though!
}}
|-
| class="ct" | Not in Mage [[Faction]]
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: I can't be seen conversing with you right now!}}
|-
! Condition
! Random Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" rowspan="3" | None
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: I am quite thirsty all the time, it's a rare condition.}}
|-
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: Why are you looking at me that way? I am not a Vampire, you are!}}
|-
| {{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &cAvorius&f: There is no sunlight either, it would be quite accommodating for a Vampire.}}
|}

== Trivia ==
*'''Avorius''' was the first vampire added to the game.

