'''Chipper McPickaxe''' is an [[NPC]] located in {{zone|The Mountaintop}}. They sell the {{Item|Anti-Sentient Pickaxe}} for {{Motes|24,999}}.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Condition
! Dialogue
|-
| class="ct" |First Interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fOi! Hands off, treasure hunter!
&eSelect an option: &a[&aWait... are you a talking pickaxe?&a] 
}}
|-
| class="ct" |Selected {{Rmt|&a[&aWait... are you a talking pickaxe?&a]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fBrilliant deduction! Next thing you'll tell me water's wet.
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fHonestly, the nerve of some people. See something shiny and think it's theirs for the taking!
&eSelect an option: &a[&aWell, you were just lying there...&a] 
}}
|-
| class="ct" |Selected {{Rmt|&a[&aWell, you were just lying there...&a]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fLying there?
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fExcuse me, I was enjoying some peace and quiet, contemplating the sedimentary layers.
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fBut since you've disturbed my geological meditation, perhaps we can make this interruption worthwhile.
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fI happen to run a little business, Care to browse the finest selection of pickaxes this side of the bedrock?
&eSelect an option: &a[&aYou are a pickaxe that sells pickaxes?&a] 
}}
|-
| class="ct" |Selected {{Rmt|&a[&aYou are a pickaxe that sells pickaxes?&a]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fWho better to trust with your mining needs? Would you buy a sword from a plow?
&eSelect an option: &a[&aYou make a compelling point.&a] 
}}
|-
| class="ct" |Selected {{Rmt|&a[&aYou make a compelling point.&a]}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fOf course I do! I'm sharp in more ways than one.
&e[NPC] Chipper McPickaxe&f: &fAnyways, if you are done talking to a tool, let's get you geared up.
}}
|}

